id: bunny-ears
name: Bunny Ears
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
craftDC: Apprentice
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Speed 1(bT) and Boosted Speed 2(bT) higher while worn.
text: >
  Bunny Ears: This bunny-eared headband makes you look cool, and you feel faster somehow.
  –Craft DC: Apprentice
  –Effects: Increase the wearer’s Normal Speed by 1(bT) and their Boosted Speed by 2(bT).

---

# While worn: "Accessories are Basic Items that can be equipped and apply benefits while
# equipped." Taken off, it does nothing.
[passive]
speed.normal += 1(bT);
speed.boosted += 2(bT);
